# Human Python dependency constraints for a deployment image.
#
# This file does not install packages. It only limits versions of packages that
# Odoo, requirements.in, or transitive dependencies already request.
#
# Keep this file empty unless the dependency resolver needs an explicit
# compatibility decision that cannot be expressed upstream immediately.
#
# If a selected addon needs an extra Python package, put that package in
# requirements.in instead. Pin it there when the direct requirement itself needs
# a known compatible version.
#
# Do not edit requirements.lock.txt by hand. Add the smallest compatible bound
# here, regenerate requirements.lock.txt, then review the diff.
#
# Examples:
# some-lib<4
# urllib3==1.26.5
